Act I: Hamlet's insults and flattery.
Scene I: The insulting of Romeo.
[Enter Hamlet and Romeo]
Hamlet:
 You lying stupid fatherless smelly coward!
 You are as sweet as the sum of a beautiful rose and a flower!
